block_id":"Q8S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b4c94a2-cc32-4640-be8f-85e236c65472","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおーインド","ts":"1629681624.278200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ls"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7751ce84-a510-4001-8918-ad2f41d8f98e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"valheimの火も土の上にしか設置できない","ts":"1629681615.277900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dse"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d95d174-3688-4374-90e9-d1abbe06b807","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"アメリカ住んでた時、賃貸の家主はインド人と日本人を好むって聞いたな。靴脱ぐから汚れにくいって。","ts":"1629681608.277700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MZQ1G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"465eac3c-42d6-4e39-81ef-459a2c5d36ca","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"割と近代化してからも土間で炊事が多かったか","ts":"1629681602.277500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6HXM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6433750a-d851-4fe5-8e50-0cf3e8434cae","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"土間で炊事してたのは竃とかの兼ね合いがありそう\n逆に言うと土間があるという事は靴を脱ぐエリアがあるという事で","ts":"1629681565.276700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4FoMK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f648a7cc-f8e9-40f4-9086-26c1cbc6c37f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"土間だったもんなぁ＞台所","ts":"1629681521.275300","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1629681543.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4p93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e01e414c-49ae-4c25-b78f-1e9c1cb6349d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"日本でのこの習慣もいつごろからなんだろう。たとえば昔はキッチンが実質外だった","ts":"1629681493.274400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5254c0f9-1fd7-4ad4-942e-936e2ed42ebf","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"日本のそれは昔からの感染症防ぐための習慣だっけな＞家で靴を脱ぐ","ts":"1629681467.273700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8M6y5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6011ca8e-abe1-4ce0-bd8a-991c62952aa0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"少なくとも日本と台湾とカナダ (少なくとも西側) はそれに属するけど、あまりよくしらない","ts":"1629681411.272800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2kE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"489e0e85-07f7-42ab-9e98-e85958ce61ec","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ふと気になった。家で靴を脱ぐ習慣がマジョリティな地域というか人口って世界のどのくらいの割合なんだろう","ts":"1629681385.272100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/t31w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"861f96c7-4174-45bb-bedb-0e7ea8f567b4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あれ、硬いとか軟らかいとかそういうので変わってきたりするんですかね","ts":"1629681334.271500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ihv99"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8288cfc4-d4c0-4360-b52f-13249b112c9f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"特に手洗いに関しては外国の水だと手の皮膚がやられるんでこまめに洗うのが難しい","ts":"1629681275.270800","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1629681322.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oi3W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a127bb9f-93d6-4c91-8850-004d537f953b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"家の中で靴を脱ぐ習慣とかもありますし、そもそも基本衛生の意識そのものは根付いてますからね\n今までそれを軽視してた人が多かっただけで、概念は浸透してる","ts":"1629681249.270500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8koo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed0d9f61-ce3e-4b2b-b9c0-5f44c7824244","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"うがい手洗いどころか風呂まで飲める水使えるってのは公衆衛生にプラス","ts":"1629681185.269000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I=F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d65a261-2840-4db7-97a8-c0cb5f66b032","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/091234ac1ea229b7c9b768d65558311064df5839\u003e","ts":"1629681174.268700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yahoo!ニュース: 塩野義製薬　新型コロナワクチン　東南アジアなどで臨床試験検討　国産ワクチン実用化加速に期待（読売テレビ） - Yahoo!ニュース","id":1,"title":"塩野義製薬　新型コロナワクチン　東南アジアなどで臨床試験検討　国産ワクチン実用化加速に期待（読売テレビ） - Yahoo!ニュース","title_link":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/091234ac1ea229b7c9b768d65558311064df5839","text":"　新型コロナワクチンを開発中の塩野義製薬は、最終段階の臨床試験を東南アジアなどで実施する方向で検討を進めていることを明らかにした。その背景には、どんな思惑があるのだろうか。 　塩野義製薬は、ワクチ","image_url":"https://amd-pctr.c.yimg.jp/r/iwiz-amd/20210819-00000103-ytv-000-11-thumb.jpg?w=640\u0026h=360\u0026q=90\u0026exp=10800\u0026pri=l","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yahoo!ニュース","service_icon":"https://s.yimg.jp/c/icon/s/bsc/2.0/news120.png","from_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/091234ac1ea229b7c9b768d65558311064df5839","original_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/091234ac1ea229b7c9b768d65558311064df5839"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vbk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5df7c5d-5257-45aa-92ae-007a82d348d8","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"日本に関しては水の質が良かったってのも幸運かなぁ","ts":"1629681139.267900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zzfn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e95f72c-8f7b-47ff-bfff-19411197ec32","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"調べたら塩野義ワクチンは東南アジアで治験するとかあるな","ts":"1629681137.267800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rtdqU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e7b65dc-8c6e-462d-a18f-315c03514746","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"効果が確認されてるワクチンが既にあるので、新しいワクチンの治験ができないというのはなるほどなと思った記憶","ts":"1629681099.267000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hl8UE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2068772-3ef5-46b2-a88a-84ec49925241","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これでまだ「抑えられている」方なのが怖い","ts":"1629681067.266200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL","UQX22KG9F"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GXG8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5dc7b338-f30a-44e9-b7c2-f51b10d77336","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"日本、幸運にも他国より感染拡大してないんで治験が進みにくいのはしゃーない","ts":"1629681040.265700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0uU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2860ec49-3ca0-409a-abae-0887093e86ca","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ダメ押しの3回目がメーカー一緒じゃなくてもいいなら使えそうな感じはしますけどね\nパンデミックそのものの収束に寄与するかはぶっちゃけ微妙なのはそう","ts":"1629680947.264800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q2xW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cad36fe-a328-4f21-8279-a93717801538","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"んー、日本の新型コロナ関連の開発って落ち着いた後を見越したものだと思ってるんで\nあまり情報見てない","ts":"1629680920.264200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jtgy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e8a6d01-4c5d-4b33-89c2-b78974028bcf","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUF021G80S1A800C2000000/\u003e\nこれが最新情報かな？","ts":"1629680850.262600","attachments":[{"fallback":"日本経済新聞: 塩野義製薬のコロナワクチン、年内に最終治験入り","id":1,"title":"塩野義製薬のコロナワクチン、年内に最終治験入り","title_link":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUF021G80S1A800C2000000/","text":"塩野義製薬は2日、開発中の新型コロナウイルスワクチンの最終段階の臨床試験（治験）を2021年内にも始めると発表した。22年3月末までの実用化を目指す。国内では米ファイザーや米モデルナなど海外メーカーのワクチンしか承認されていない。国産ワクチンを巡っては、第一三共が22年中に実用化する方針を掲げている。最終段階の治験は、他社製のワクチンとの比較か偽薬との比較のいずれかの方式で行う。ワクチン同士の","image_url":"https://article-image-ix.nikkei.com/https%3A%2F%2Fimgix-proxy.n8s.jp%2FDSXZQO0890687002082021000000-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress\u0026ch=Width%2CDPR\u0026q=45\u0026fit=crop\u0026bg=FFFFFF\u0026w=1200\u0026h=630\u0026fp-x=0.5\u0026fp-y=0.5\u0026fp-z=1\u0026crop=focalpoint\u0026ixlib=js-1.4.1\u0026s=67a4a7562d646bda676fba42cb66e6eb","blocks":null,"ts":1627902072,"service_name":"日本経済新聞","service_icon":"https://www.nikkei.com/.resources/k-components/180.rev-79352c3.png","from_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUF021G80S1A800C2000000/","original_url":"https://www.nikkei.com/article/DGXZQOUF021G80S1A800C2000000/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AZap"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b93892b-73ef-482e-a430-6bf4ffdb453f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"自国生産できるかどうかもわからないならそうなるよな・・・","ts":"1629680814.262200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xj+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb344bf4-9c04-4389-b552-5c6f2bf4c2a3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"塩野義ワクチン続報出てるんだろうか","ts":"1629680778.261500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z71"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f48046a7-0030-442d-be35-553a414dde67","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあそれが最適解かとか想定通りだったかというと分からないですけど","ts":"1629680763.260800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YAD0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d850072-3395-465d-8d58-bcdff09518c4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"仮に自国生産できて廃棄上等なら、まぁ供給能力にも限界あるけど、最悪1アンプルから接種1人で残り廃棄みたいな運用もなくはない。","ts":"1629680749.260200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AD/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e73e87d-f727-411e-be28-8fd797a2b84a","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"結果としてシビアながらもシステムをだいぶFuzzyに倒して「打ちたい人がとりあえず打てる」状況に持っていった感じがある","ts":"1629680728.259900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mgsE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c602c26-5315-476e-91c0-91451791e23c","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"大人しく2〜3週間程度待ってみます（2回目接種の人たちとの情報戦と被りそうだけれど）","ts":"1629680707.259300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jwJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"088b9328-950b-445f-a709-2693d0dfda84","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"想定してたワクチンの仕様上仕方なかったのか","ts":"1629680562.256100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TOvw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"451bb81c-c103-4c5d-8fad-1610430f073f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"確か再冷凍効かなかった気がしますし","ts":"1629680547.255800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ePsP1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af734d40-e4b1-4cd2-81b6-765b9746bfaf","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"確定分しか解凍できないし、ドタキャンとかも含めてよりシビアになると考えるとしょうがなかった面はありそう","ts":"1629680523.254700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YFH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98649121-27f3-48ee-9588-9a99d99ac33f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"「予約が必要」だったのは計画段階では、まだワクチンの解凍してからの消費期限が短かったことが関係してるんです。あと全員分はあるけど人口の何倍もあったわけではないことも。","ts":"1629680444.253200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629680462.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f03e4f63-1a57-4c7b-9629-817ec527b24d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"すべての行列ができる店にこういう仕組みを導入してほしい","ts":"1629680396.252600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DW=n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fd3070d-8610-44d0-a917-52acd9bb4c67","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ぶっちゃけ印刷所暇なんだから\n日時指定のハガキに返信用の希望日時ハガキのセット用意して\n郵送したら終わる","ts":"1629680291.250900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0wW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c49d13bc-740e-4811-8432-aaf468dec060","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ワクチン接種に関しては\n「予約が必要」ってのが悪手な気がしてる","ts":"1629680181.249500","edited":{"user":"U782D5DF1","ts":"1629680341.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cbHE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0007BC1E-D3D2-4629-BE97-0E06BD6B07CE","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"なお個別接種は輻輳制御によるアナウンスが出てる状態、自治体の方は20分くらい待たされている\n予約できる気がしない","ts":"1629678471.248200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8gq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C0C1BE22-7064-4D07-A5A6-B596DDF43DDD","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"仮想待合室はなるほどなと思った\n\u003chttps://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/4caa355e8dd5a89dfe4c96fe81570c69e26d4ec0|https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/4caa355e8dd5a89dfe4c96fe81570c69e26d4ec0\u003e","ts":"1629678408.246400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Yahoo!ニュース: ワクチン予約サイトのアクセス集中、特効薬は“仮想待合室”の設置にあり（ITmedia NEWS） - Yahoo!ニュース","id":1,"title":"ワクチン予約サイトのアクセス集中、特効薬は“仮想待合室”の設置にあり（ITmedia NEWS） - Yahoo!ニュース","title_link":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/4caa355e8dd5a89dfe4c96fe81570c69e26d4ec0","text":"　予約開始時間に新型コロナワクチン接種の予約サイトにアクセスを試みても、いつまで経っても繋がらずに予約枠が終了、さらにはシステムが過負荷でダウンして受付が一時中止に──こんなニュースが2021年4月","image_url":"https://amd-pctr.c.yimg.jp/r/iwiz-amd/20210621-00000038-zdn_n-000-1-view.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Yahoo!ニュース","service_icon":"https://s.yimg.jp/c/icon/s/bsc/2.0/news120.png","from_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/4caa355e8dd5a89dfe4c96fe81570c69e26d4ec0","original_url":"https://news.yahoo.co.jp/articles/4caa355e8dd5a89dfe4c96fe81570c69e26d4ec0"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_origi